  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p>Turn your built grid into a file you can share or print, then clean up the map afterwards.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "slideset",
      "source": "canonical",
      "slides": [
        {
          "title": "Save the grid",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>When your edits are done, select <strong>Save</strong> and tick any combination of <strong>KMZ</strong>, <strong>PDF</strong>, <strong>JPEG</strong> or <strong>Settings (JSON)</strong>.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>KMZ</strong> with <strong>Flatten map items to image</strong> drops the grid onto the map and into Overlay Manager</li>\n<li><strong>PDF</strong> can <strong>Append to PDF</strong>, <strong>Include geospatial data</strong> or <strong>Create multiple pages</strong></li>\n<li><strong>JPEG</strong> can <strong>Create multiple images</strong></li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/6b6154a9d232b8c0.webp",
              "width": 800,
              "height": 519
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Open capture settings",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Select the <strong>Settings</strong> (gear) icon on the toolbar to configure how the GRG is captured.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/c3a51e185c872841.webp",
              "width": 432,
              "height": 71
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Configure the capture",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Set <strong>Auto-import GRG capture</strong>, pick a <strong>Resolution</strong> (<strong>Low</strong> or <strong>High</strong>), and enable <strong>Scaled Printable Map</strong> to choose a <strong>Page Size</strong>. Select <strong>Done</strong> to confirm. Note: Scaled Printable Map may limit your GRG customization options.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/4fd7562c0d5d2d61.webp",
              "width": 800,
              "height": 481
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Delete map items",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>To clear the map items you placed while building the GRG, select <strong>Delete</strong> (trash) from the toolbar.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/565591385cd6d27d.webp",
              "width": 432,
              "height": 71
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
